{{!-- Doctor tier-confirmation reminder — bilingual.

      WHY THIS EXISTS. Until 2026-08-29 the only outreach a doctor could
      receive was doctor-welcome.hbs, which opens "set your password". On
      2026-08-29, 30 of 31 doctors had not confirmed their turnaround tiers
      and six of them had ALREADY logged in and set a password weeks earlier
      — so the one email the platform could send them was telling them to do
      a thing they had already done. That is very likely part of why they
      ignored it. This template is for the doctor who is already through the
      door and has exactly one step left.

      It carries no magic-login token: these doctors have a password. It
      links to the services page directly.

      EDIT ALL FOUR BLOCKS. Two files (en/, ar/) x two language blocks each.
      Both files carry BOTH languages, ordered so the block matching
      user.lang comes first — same convention as doctor-welcome.hbs, and for
      the same reason: users.lang was a hardcoded default for most of these
      accounts, so it is not a stated preference and dropping a language
      would guess wrong. Editing only the top block of each file is the
      mistake that shipped an email naming the 18-hour tier two different
      things in its two halves.

      BODY PARTIAL — renderEmail() wraps it in _layout.hbs. No document
      shell, masthead or footer here.

      Variables: firstName, nameAr, specialtyEn, specialtyAr,
                 servicesCount, servicesUrl.

      Handlebars comment, stripped at compile time. Never write comment
      delimiters or mustache braces inside it — a nested closing delimiter
      ends the comment early and dumps this text into the sent email. --}}

<!-- ================= ARABIC ================= -->
<div dir="rtl" style="text-align:right;">

<h1 style="margin:0 0 22px;font:400 24px/1.4 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#0B6B5F;">
  خطوة واحدة متبقية في حسابك على تشخيصة
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 16px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  عزيزي د. {{nameAr}}،
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  حسابك معتمد ومفعّل{{#if specialtyAr}} في تخصص <strong style="color:#0B6B5F;font-weight:600;">{{specialtyAr}}</strong>{{/if}}. بقيت خطوة واحدة قبل أن تصلك الحالات: تأكيد مدد التسليم التي توافق على العمل بها.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  قمنا بتحديد{{#if servicesCount}} كل الـ {{servicesCount}}{{/if}} خدمة في تخصصك نيابةً عنك، لذا الأمر مراجعة وليس نموذجاً تملؤه. أزل التحديد عن أي خدمة لا ترغب في استقبالها. يستغرق الأمر دقيقة تقريباً.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  المدد الثلاث هي <strong>عادي (٤٨ ساعة)</strong> و<strong>سريع (١٨ ساعة)</strong> و<strong>عاجل (٤ ساعات، من ٧ صباحاً حتى ٧ مساءً بتوقيت القاهرة)</strong>. اختر فقط المدة التي يمكنك الالتزام بها فعلاً — تأخر التسليم يعني رد رسوم الاستعجال للمريض، ونفضّل أن تختار عدداً أقل وتلتزم به.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 26px;">
  <a href="{{servicesUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;background:#0B6B5F;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font:600 15px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">
    تأكيد خدماتي
  </a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font:400 14px/1.7 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#6B655C;">
  إذا نسيت كلمة المرور، استخدم "نسيت كلمة المرور" في صفحة تسجيل الدخول. ويمكنك الرد على هذه الرسالة إن كان أي شيء غير واضح — سيصلك رد من شخص حقيقي.
</p>

</div>

<div style="height:1px;background:#E6E1D8;margin:34px 0;"></div>

<!-- ================= ENGLISH ================= -->
<div dir="ltr" style="text-align:left;">

<h1 style="margin:0 0 22px;font:400 24px/1.4 Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;color:#0B6B5F;">
  One step left on your Tashkheesa account
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 16px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  Dear Dr. {{firstName}},
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  Your account is approved and active{{#if specialtyEn}} in <strong style="color:#0B6B5F;font-weight:600;">{{specialtyEn}}</strong>{{/if}}. There is one thing left before cases can reach you: confirming which turnaround times you are willing to take.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  We have already ticked{{#if servicesCount}} all {{servicesCount}}{{/if}} of the services in your specialty for you, so this is a review rather than a form to fill in. Untick anything you would rather not take. It takes about a minute.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 18px;font:400 15px/1.75 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#2E2B26;">
  The three turnarounds are <strong>standard (48 hours)</strong>, <strong>fast track (18 hours)</strong> and <strong>urgent (4 hours, 7am&ndash;7pm Cairo time)</strong>. Only tick a tier you can genuinely meet — a missed deadline refunds the patient's surcharge, so we would rather you took fewer tiers and kept them.
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 26px;">
  <a href="{{servicesUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;background:#0B6B5F;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font:600 15px/1 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;">
    Confirm my services
  </a>
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font:400 14px/1.7 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;color:#6B655C;">
  If you have forgotten your password, use "Forgot password" on the sign-in page. Reply to this email if anything is unclear &mdash; it reaches a person.
</p>

</div>
